<title>USA: Prudential Insurance open to Florida talks.</title>
<headline>Prudential Insurance open to Florida talks.</headline>
<dateline>NEWARK, N.J. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Insurance Co of America said on Monday that it is open to talks with Florida officials about allegations of deceptive sales practices by its agents.</p>
<p>Florida Insurance Commissioner Bill Nelson earlier today accused the insurance company of obstructing a state probe into allegations that the company had misrepresented its insurance products.</p>
</text>
